{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_2000_situation", "source_sha256": "f3a451ff971daf58b6c18fee614530673b9bf02dde4d2e75b71ebc5691551adf", "ja": "温泉地でのロケ　終了後", "zh": "温泉区的外景　结束后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_2000_place", "source_sha256": "7c09ecc773e6713290f186a82f5b34d4cc50783111d09ed5a430f59b3cd1001d", "ja": "温泉旅館前", "zh": "温泉旅馆前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_2001_031tom", "source_sha256": "e5bc780730d2a9d5fbaa7e2e7afac7f63460a8a25c000d1f06d589767453ca59", "ja": "うふふ、とっても、いいお湯でしたね～♪\nお仕事とはいえ、身も心も癒されました～♪", "zh": "呵呵，这温泉真的很棒呢～♪\n虽说是来工作，但身心都好放松～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_2002_031tom", "source_sha256": "ff2fa72528f428295028974d3b77da42c480fbb8edfd2aa5a4c9454c0e4a741e", "ja": "どうしたんですか、{$P$}さん～？\nいつも以上にくたびれて見えますが、温泉は……？", "zh": "怎么了吗，{$P$}先生～？\n你看起来比平常更疲惫，温泉呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_2003_p", "source_sha256": "ec2c76a3ad14dc0dcb662b428a6233be1ad179f189404a61bd59bde60ad02179", "ja": "ああ、うん。せっかくだけど、忙しくて入りそびれたな\n……まぁ、仕事だから仕方がないんだけど。", "zh": "喔，这个啊，虽然难得来一趟，但我忙到没机会泡……\n因为是工作，也没办法就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_2004_031tom", "source_sha256": "7316976def34b8b9a5ece426fc17402f4fff16b78261311698018d6bc8ef42ef", "ja": "そうでしたか～。それでは……はい、\n{$P$}さん。おひとつどうぞ～♪", "zh": "原来是这样啊～那么……来，\n{$P$}先生，请吃一个～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_2005_p", "source_sha256": "062b62a929e14e22192b2e476ff76262c47ca91c2dc861c9669476e51130ac1e", "ja": "これは……温泉まんじゅう？\nお土産じゃないのか？", "zh": "这是……温泉馒头？\n这不是伴手礼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_2006_031tom", "source_sha256": "b5369f4780c75e354df66e667519afedf6da7c85a18a2152e0276133ddbbc6cc", "ja": "うふふ、いいんですよ～。かわいそうな\n{$P$}さんに、おすそわけです～。", "zh": "呵呵，没关系唷～这是分给\n可怜的{$P$}先生的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_2007_031tom", "source_sha256": "0e6271bdf51d3e021bbfa7401db72569dd08b34ed59344ea4a84486f13e5d21a", "ja": "温泉には入れませんでしたが、代わりに……\n聖母手ずからの恵みで、癒されてくださいね～♪", "zh": "虽然没机会泡温泉，取而代之的是……\n请用圣母亲自交付的恩典，来放松身心吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
